[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "レスナ、あなたには\n錬金術の時代を作り上げてほしいの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "かつて私たちが過ごした錬金術による幸せな時代をね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "問題の赤のほうき星は、今もどこかの星々を\n回遊しているということですか？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "ええ。赤のほうき星の群れがいつかまた、この星に\n来るかもしれない。私たちは定期的に観測してるのよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "今回、その観測に時間が掛かったせいで、ヘルトたちが\n暴れすぎてしまったようね、ごめんなさい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "観測の結論として今、赤のほうき星の群れが来ることは\nないわ。はぐれた個体がやって来る可能性はあるけれど",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "はぐれた個体なら、過去と同じように対応できる。\n群れに対しても「箱船計画」というものを考えているし",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "だから、まずはこれからの世界の話をしましょう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "……これからの世界では、師匠たちパルメ族が\n今の人類の「管理」から手を引くということですか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "いいえ。それは違うわ、レスナ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "では、これからもパルメ族が、\n人類の歴史に裏から干渉してくるってことですか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "レスナによって錬金術が再発見されたけれど、\nそれですべてが解決されるわけじゃない――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "これからも、危険な野望を持つ者はきっと現れるし。\n錬金術を悪用したりね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "だけどレスナは、そんなことを気にせず、\n錬金術の救世主として新時代を導いてくれればいい……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "その他のことは私たちに任せて。\n必ず、あなたたちをより良い未来へ導いてあげるから",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "いいえ、パルメ族の「管理」は必要ありません",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "果ての大陸へ繋がる門を守っていた「案内人」は\n私に、命の「選択」を問いかけてきました――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "大勢のために個の犠牲を受け入れるという「選択」……\nそれが、パルメ族の考え方",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私は、あなたたちの考え方には賛同できません。\n「箱船計画」というのも、恐らくは……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "いざとなれば、星を渡る船に選ばれた者を乗せて\nほうき星から避難。新天地で世界を存続させる計画よ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "選ばれた者って、パルメ族の基準で助ける人を選ぶ、\nそういうことですよね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私は、復興した錬金術で、すべての人を救いたい。\nすべての人を救えるような世界を目指したい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "だから、あなたたちの「管理」は不要です！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "レスナ……それは理想論よ。\n叶わない夢を見て、あなたが傷つくだけだわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "叶わない夢なんかじゃない",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "レスナなら、錬金術の力で叶えられる！\nこれまでの旅で見てきたから、分かるのよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "レスナはあんたたちと違って、寄り添うことができる。\nだからこそ進める未来があるって",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "ヴァレリア……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "ヴァレリアの言う通りっすわ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "それに、いつまでもあんな「管理」とか「天命」とか\nされてちゃ、発展するもんもしないでしょ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "いつ、どこで、人間輝くか分かんないっすから。\n人類の可能性を、勝手に決めないでください！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "アルビーナ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "……それが必ずしも良い方向へ傾くとも限らないわ。\n最悪の結末が待っているかもしれない",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "それなら、最小限の犠牲を受け入れ、\nみんなで平和に過ごすのが一番でしょう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "私たちパルメ族なら、それができるわ。\n過去の痛みが経験としてあるから、なおさらにね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "復興した錬金術で、あなたたち人類を\nより良い未来へ導いてみせる",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "もう二度と、あんな悲劇を繰り返さないために――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "あなたたち人類のためなのよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "だからお願い、レスナ。\n私たちの手を取ってちょうだい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "……私に、錬金術の素晴らしさを\n教えてくれたのは師匠です",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "錬金術でみんなを幸せにしたい……\nこの夢は、師匠からもらったものです！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私が錬金術士である限り、\n誰かが犠牲になるような未来は選びません！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "そう……頑固なのね。\n仕方ないわ――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "こうなったら、力ずくでも分かってもらうしかないわね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 8393915555796547279,
    "text": "――レスナ、私は、\nあなたに幸せになってほしいの……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3628130916430439847,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "localized_name": "ザスキア",
    "romanized_name": "Saskia",
    "model_path_hash": 4133374622192791467,
    "text": "あなたたち人類のために、ここは譲れないわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 9219030455227289335,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私だって、意見を変えるつもりはありません",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "この力で、証明してみせます",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "私の――私たちの、想いの強さを！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]